2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (The\040Automated\040Box\040and\040Blocks\040Test\040an\040Autonomous\040Assessment\040Method\040of\040Gross\040Manual\040Dexterity\040in\040Stroke\040Rehabilitation)
/Author (Edwin\040Daniel\040Oña\054\040Alberto\040Jardón\054\040Carlos\040Balaguer)
/Subject (Traditional\040motor\040assessment\040is\040carried\040out\040by\040clinicians\040using\040standard\040clinical\040tests\040in\040order\040to\040have\040objectivity\040in\040the\040evaluation\054\040but\040this\040manual\040procedure\040is\040liable\040to\040the\040observer\040subjectivity\056\040In\040this\040article\054\040an\040automatic\040assessment\040system\040based\040on\040the\040Box\040and\040Blocks\040Test\040\050BBT\051\040of\040manual\040dexterity\040is\040presented\056\040Also\054\040the\040automatic\040test\040administration\040and\040the\040motor\040performance\040of\040the\040user\040is\040addressed\056\040Through\040cameras\040RGB\055D\040the\040execution\040of\040the\040test\040and\040the\040patient\220s\040movements\040are\040monitored\056\040Based\040on\040colour\040segmentation\054\040the\040cubes\040displaced\040by\040the\040user\040are\040detected\040and\040the\040traditional\040scoring\040is\040automatically\040calculated\056\040Furthermore\054\040a\040pilot\040trial\040in\040a\040hospital\040environment\040was\040conducted\054\040to\040compare\040the\040automatic\040system\040and\040its\040effectiveness\040with\040respect\040to\040the\040traditional\040one\056\040The\040results\040support\040the\040use\040of\040automatic\040assessment\040methods\040of\040motor\040functionality\054\040which\040in\040combination\040with\040robotic\040rehabilitation\040systems\054\040could\040address\040an\040autonomous\040and\040objective\040rehabilitation\040process\056)
/Keywords (19\040Jul\0402017\054\040Conference\040Towards\040Autonomous\040Robotic\040Systems\054\040Carlos\040III\040Health\040Institute)
>>
endobj
